      "SPECIAL ABILITIES": [
        "Delta Attack (su) When three movers select a single target they can choose to use this ability: The chosen target is engulfed by glowing triangles then must make a Fortitude save (DC 23) or suffer the Statue status effect. The movers need to recharge their ability for 1d4+1 rounds to use it again.",
